---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service — DCS Y2K">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[820px] p-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="h-display mb-4 text-[56px] md:text-[72px]">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="eyebrow mb-12 border-b border-ink pb-6 text-mute">Last updated: September 23, 2026</p>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 leading-relaxed text-body">
      <section>
        <h2 class="h-display mb-3 text-[26px]">1. Acceptance of terms</h2>
        <p>By browsing or placing an order on this site, you agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="h-display mb-3 text-[26px]">2. Orders and pricing</h2>
        <p>All prices are shown in USD and may change without notice. We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any order, including for suspected fraud or pricing errors.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="h-display mb-3 text-[26px]">3. Accounts</h2>
        <p>You are responsible for keeping your account credentials secure and for all activity under your account. Notify us immediately if you suspect unauthorized use.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="h-display mb-3 text-[26px]">4. Shipping and returns</h2>
        <p>Shipping timelines and return eligibility are described on our Shipping & returns page. Free worldwide shipping applies to every order unless stated otherwise.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="h-display mb-3 text-[26px]">5. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>All product photography, text, and branding on this site belong to DCS Y2K and may not be reused without permission.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="h-display mb-3 text-[26px]">6. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>DCS Y2K is not liable for indirect or incidental damages arising from use of this site or its products, to the maximum extent permitted by law.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="h-display mb-3 text-[26px]">7. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
